# KosmicKrisp's RGB32 texel buffers on a GPU whose own have none (before Apple family 11), hukan's:
# such a view is made an R32 one three times as wide, flagged in its 16-byte descriptor, and the
# shader reads its three texels and puts them together. RGB32 texture buffers are core GL from 4.0
# (ARB_texture_buffer_object_rgb32), and the guest's Zink offers 4.0 and up only with them.
# Applied by Vendor/build-mesa.sh over the pinned Mesa commit.
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_buffer_view.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_buffer_view.c
